{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hide your eggs well</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone starts with a basket of random eggs to hide. Be creative \u2014 find the most unthinkable spots, reach places no one else can, or hide in plain sight to bluff your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/fe6db195e4ebc518d1dfefd3401fac7d.poster.avif?t=1773396976\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/fe6db195e4ebc518d1dfefd3401fac7d.webm?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/fe6db195e4ebc518d1dfefd3401fac7d.mp4?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race to find the most eggs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the seeking phase begins, race to find as many eggs as possible. The minimap shows which areas still hide eggs. Be faster than your friends \u2014 or slow them down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/d836f1a0d324e6d06965917f93cdf6ae.poster.avif?t=1773396976\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/d836f1a0d324e6d06965917f93cdf6ae.webm?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/d836f1a0d324e6d06965917f93cdf6ae.mp4?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items, Traps &amp; Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up a variety of items to help you find eggs, like the Egg Radar or hint pictures. Trick your friends with fake exploding eggs. You can also interact with the environment and move smaller objects to hide your eggs even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/a94c3004b2b3c634afe8f6ca70cecc64.poster.avif?t=1773396976\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/a94c3004b2b3c634afe8f6ca70cecc64.webm?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/a94c3004b2b3c634afe8f6ca70cecc64.mp4?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u20134 player online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer egg hunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps (WIP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization (WIP)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990510?t=1773396976","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990510?t=1773396976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/0f45ce3414aae8f6b5d908c2cb66f61862b8864d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773396976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/0f45ce3414aae8f6b5d908c2cb66f61862b8864d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773396976","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hide your eggs well</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone starts with a basket of random eggs to hide. Be creative \u2014 find the most unthinkable spots, reach places no one else can, or hide in plain sight to bluff your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/fe6db195e4ebc518d1dfefd3401fac7d.poster.avif?t=1773396976\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/fe6db195e4ebc518d1dfefd3401fac7d.webm?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/fe6db195e4ebc518d1dfefd3401fac7d.mp4?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race to find the most eggs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the seeking phase begins, race to find as many eggs as possible. The minimap shows which areas still hide eggs. Be faster than your friends \u2014 or slow them down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/d836f1a0d324e6d06965917f93cdf6ae.poster.avif?t=1773396976\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/d836f1a0d324e6d06965917f93cdf6ae.webm?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/d836f1a0d324e6d06965917f93cdf6ae.mp4?t=1773396976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items, Traps &amp; Environment</strong><